    "Brings loud passages down toward quiet ones. Makeup gain raises the result again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Brings loud passages down toward quiet ones. Makeup gain raises the result again."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大きな部分を小さな部分に近づけます．メイクアップゲインで全体をもう一度持ち上げます．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将较响的段落压低，使其接近较安静的段落。补偿增益会再把整体提升回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Brings this source to the loudness set in Settings › Audio, however loud or quiet it plays on its own. With the original sound replaced, it evens out what you hear too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Brings this source to the loudness set in Settings › Audio, however loud or quiet it plays on its own. With the original sound replaced, it evens out what you hear too."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このソースを，もとの音が大きくても小さくても，設定 › オーディオで決めた音量に近づけます．元の音を置き換えている場合は，聞こえる音も揃います．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无论此音源本身播放得多响或多轻，都会将其调整到“设置 › 音频”中设定的响度。替换原声后，你听到的响度也会随之统一。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
