    "Even out loudness: bring everything this mix plays to the loudness set in Settings › Audio, so one video, site or song is about as loud as the next": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Even out loudness: bring everything this mix plays to the loudness set in Settings › Audio, so one video, site or song is about as loud as the next"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ラウドネスを揃える：このミックスの音すべてを，設定 › オーディオで決めた音量に近づけ，動画やサイト，曲が変わっても同じくらいの大きさで聞こえるようにします"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "统一响度：将此混音播放的所有内容调整到“设置 › 音频”中设定的响度，让不同的视频、网站或歌曲听起来音量大致相同"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every mix runs on its own. Start as many as you need at once.": {
