    "Off: the app still plays straight to its device and this mix works on a copy. Effects change what the mix sends, not what you hear from the app itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off: the app still plays straight to its device and this mix works on a copy. Effects change what the mix sends, not what you hear from the app itself."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オフ：アプリは自分のデバイスにそのまま出力し，このミックスはコピーを扱います．エフェクトが変えるのはミックスの送る音で，アプリ自身から聞こえる音は変わりません．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭：App 仍直接通过它的设备播放，此混音处理的是一份副本。效果只改变混音发送出去的声音，不影响你直接从 App 听到的声音。"
          }
        }
