          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Same in every language"
    },
    "Tapdeck devices — what a mix sends": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapdeck devices — what a mix sends"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapdeck のデバイス — ミックスの出力"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapdeck 设备 — 混音发送的内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tapdeck is turning peaks down by %.1f dB here so they do not distort. To avoid it, turn a source or the mix down, or turn the device volume up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapdeck is turning peaks down by %.1f dB here so they do not distort. To avoid it, turn a source or the mix down, or turn the device volume up."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "歪まないよう，Tapdeck がここでピークを %.1f dB 下げています．避けるには，ソースかミックスの音量を下げるか，デバイスの音量を上げてください．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapdeck 正在此处将峰值降低 %.1f dB，以免失真。若要避免这种情况，请调低音源或混音的音量，或调高设备音量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Target": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Target"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目標"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Tapdeck driver is not installed. Run: sudo ./install-driver.sh": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Tapdeck driver is not installed. Run: sudo ./install-driver.sh"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapdeck のドライバがインストールされていません．次を実行してください：sudo ./install-driver.sh"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装 Tapdeck 驱动程序。请运行：sudo ./install-driver.sh"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app menu and file dialogs change the next time Tapdeck starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app menu and file dialogs change the next time Tapdeck starts."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリメニューとファイルダイアログは，次回 Tapdeck を起動したときに切り替わります．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 菜单和文件对话框会在 Tapdeck 下次启动时切换语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app's own output is silenced while this mix runs, so you hear only Tapdeck's version — with these effects, at this mix's volume, on this mix's outputs. It comes back on its own when the mix stops.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app's own output is silenced while this mix runs, so you hear only Tapdeck's version — with these effects, at this mix's volume, on this mix's outputs. It comes back on its own when the mix stops."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このミックスの実行中は，アプリ自身の出力が消えるので，Tapdeck の音だけが聞こえます．エフェクトもミックスの音量も出力も，Tapdeck のものが使われます．ミックスを止めると，自動で元に戻ります．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此混音运行时，该 App 自身的输出会被静音，你只会听到经 Tapdeck 处理的声音：带有这些效果，采用此混音的音量，并从此混音的输出播放。混音停止后，App 的输出会自动恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app's own sound is silenced while this mix runs": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app's own sound is silenced while this mix runs"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このミックスの実行中は，アプリ自身の音が消えます"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此混音运行时，该 App 自身的声音会被静音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device's own volume, the one the volume keys change when it is the Mac's output. Every app playing to it hears the change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The device's own volume, the one the volume keys change when it is the Mac's output. Every app playing to it hears the change."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "デバイス自身の音量です．Mac の出力のときは，音量キーで変わる音量です．このデバイスに出力するすべてのアプリに影響します．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备自身的音量，即该设备作为 Mac 的输出时音量键所调节的音量。所有通过它播放的 App 都会受此更改影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The driver is not installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The driver is not installed."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ドライバがインストールされていません．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装驱动程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The driver rejected the device list (OSStatus %lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The driver rejected the device list (OSStatus %lld)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ドライバがデバイスの一覧を受け付けませんでした（OSStatus %lld）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "驱动程序拒绝了设备列表（OSStatus %lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The main output has %lld channels, so each source can take its own pair.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The main output has %lld channels, so each source can take its own pair."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "メイン出力は %lld チャンネルあるので，ソースごとに専用のペアを割り当てられます．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主输出有 %lld 个声道，因此每个音源都可以使用各自的声道对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The main output's clock drives the mix, and channel placement refers to its channels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The main output's clock drives the mix, and channel placement refers to its channels."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "メイン出力のクロックがミックスを動かし，チャンネルの割り当てはそのチャンネルを基準にします．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "混音由主输出的时钟驱动，声道分配也以其声道为准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menu bar item starts and stops mixes without opening the window. On a notched display a full menu bar may leave no room for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The menu bar item starts and stops mixes without opening the window. On a notched display a full menu bar may leave no room for it."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "メニューバーの項目から，ウインドウを開かずにミックスを開始・停止できます．ノッチのあるディスプレイでは，メニューバーがいっぱいだと表示される場所がないことがあります．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过菜单栏项目，无需打开窗口即可开始和停止混音。在带刘海的显示屏上，如果菜单栏已满，可能没有空间显示该项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original sound is silenced while this mix runs. Add a speaker or headphones output to hear it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original sound is silenced while this mix runs. Add a speaker or headphones output to hear it."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このミックスの実行中は，元の音は消えます．聞くにはスピーカーかヘッドホンの出力を追加してください．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此混音运行时，原声会被静音。若要听到声音，请添加扬声器或耳机输出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stream stopped: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The stream stopped: %@"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ストリームが停止しました：%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕捕获已停止：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Mac"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この Mac"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This mix's level on the device, against other apps playing there. The fader above is the device's own volume.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This mix's level on the device, against other apps playing there. The fader above is the device's own volume."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "デバイス上のこのミックスのレベルです（そこで再生するほかのアプリとの比較）．上のフェーダーはデバイス自身の音量です．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此混音在该设备上相对于其他正在播放的 App 的电平。上方的推子是设备自身的音量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This mix's volume, for everything it sends": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This mix's volume, for everything it sends"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このミックスの音量（送るすべての音に適用）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此混音的音量，适用于其发送的所有内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This would feed back on itself: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This would feed back on itself: %@"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自分自身にフィードバックしてしまいます：%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会形成反馈回路：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Threshold": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
