    "“Even out loudness” on a mix or a source brings whatever plays to the target, so one video, site or song is about as loud as the next. Quiet material is raised by at most the maximum boost, so background noise is not blown up. Gentle keeps the rise and fall inside a song or film; Fast evens out more. Silence and short pauses leave the level alone, and a peak limiter at −1 dBFS catches sudden jumps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Even out loudness” on a mix or a source brings whatever plays to the target, so one video, site or song is about as loud as the next. Quiet material is raised by at most the maximum boost, so background noise is not blown up. Gentle keeps the rise and fall inside a song or film; Fast evens out more. Silence and short pauses leave the level alone, and a peak limiter at −1 dBFS catches sudden jumps."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ミックスやソースの「ラウドネスを揃える」は，再生される音を目標の音量に近づけ，動画やサイト，曲が変わっても同じくらいの大きさで聞こえるようにします．小さい音は最大ブーストまでしか上げないので，背景のノイズが大きくなりすぎることはありません．「ゆるやか」は曲や映画の中の強弱を残し，「速い」はより強く揃えます．無音や短い間は音量を変えず，−1 dBFS のピークリミッターが急な増加を抑えます．"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对混音或音源开启“统一响度”后，正在播放的任何内容都会被调整到目标响度，因此不同的视频、网站或歌曲听起来响度大致相同。安静的内容最多只会按“最大提升”的值提升，因此背景噪声不会被过度放大。“柔和”会保留歌曲或影片内部的强弱起伏；“快速”则统一得更彻底。遇到静音和短暂停顿时电平保持不变，−1 dBFS 的峰值限制器会抑制突然的跳升。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
